      "key": "text-80bed40549",
      "label": "Paragraph",
      "section": "Low-dose radiation therapy for joint pain.",
      "value": "For selected patients, low-dose radiation therapy may offer a painless, noninvasive option for persistent pain from certain inflammatory and degenerative conditions."
    },
